Puzzles, Hiding Spots, and Chases</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will solve bizarre, surreal puzzles, hide from classic literary &quot;monsters&quot; within the dreamscape, and run for your life when hiding is no longer an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.poster.avif?t=1788246089\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.webm?t=1788246089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.mp4?t=1788246089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned DLCs will expand into the worlds of other books and authors. Nightmares come in many forms, and every story read has the power to warp reality in its own twisted way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't fear the monsters. Fear what hides behind them.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A first-person psychological horror game where literary classics twist into a teenager’s personal nightmares. Explore the bleak worlds of Nikolai Gogol, evade monsters straight out of classic books, and solve puzzles to help a young girl conquer her deepest fears.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Turkish, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/9e5b4a12ee8b0032ea3c945c582ecdb59f1a843b/header.jpg?t=1788246089", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass